1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,930
Empezamos en el norte de Europa,

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:03,390
en Noruega:

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,950
el gravlaks, salado y fresco,

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,370
salmón crudo curado con sal y eneldo,

5
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:11,150
con galletas y verduras encurtidas.

6
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,490
Seguimos al Báltico,

7
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,490
a Estonia:

8
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:17,070
el munavõi, un untable salado de manteca batida

9
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,350
con huevo duro que se pone sobre pan.

10
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,550
Viajamos a Asia Central,

11
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,990
a Tayikistán:

12
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,610
el qurutob, salado y ácido,

13
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:28,390
pan plano con bolas de queso seco remojadas,

14
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,470
cebolla y tomate,

15
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,970
que se come con las manos.

16
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,410
Seguimos al sudeste de Asia,

17
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:34,470
a Laos:

18
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,890
el larb, salado y cítrico,

19
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,510
carne picada con lima,

20
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,350
hierbas y arroz tostado molido,

21
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,950
con arroz glutinoso.

22
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,430
Cruzamos hasta África Occidental,

23
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:45,190
a Ghana:

24
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,510
el red red,

25
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,130
salado y especiado,

26
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,430
un guiso de porotos con aceite de palma,

27
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,730
con plátano frito.

28
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,890
Y terminamos en Túnez:

29
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:56,890
el bambalouni, dulce y esponjoso,

30
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,650
una dona frita con azúcar,

31
00:00:58,740 --> 00:00:59,810
ideal con un café.

